# Built-in lesson. Text fields are bilingual "English|Chinese" (format: src/song/Song.h).
title: Lesson 2: First Frets|第2课 第一次按品
artist: Exercise|练习
bpm: 60
time: 4/4
level: 1
desc: Practice frets 0, 1 and 3 on strings 1 and 2 (string 1: E F G, string 2: B C D). Use your index finger on fret 1 and your ring finger on fret 3.|在 1 弦和 2 弦上练习 0、1、3 品 (1弦: E F G, 2弦: B C D). 1 品用食指, 3 品用无名指.
desc: Tip: press just behind the fret wire with your fingertip standing upright, so the note rings clean instead of buzzing.|小贴士: 手指按在品丝的左边 (靠近品丝), 用指尖立起来按, 声音才干净不"嗡嗡"响.
